{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/cac862b8e5855549b648a296d64c1d4e.avif?t=1755661994\" data-has-big width=1560 height=494 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thousand years after nuclear fire scorched the Earth, you awaken aboard a decaying orbital station. You descend into the southern Andes \u2014 one of the last regions spared from the blasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native forests reclaim the land, rivers carve through broken highways, and scattered ruins hint at the lives once lived here. Few survivors remain</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP or PVP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a friend! - local or online.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE &amp; TRADE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/3a3b0c8ae81bfe5e00565d87ebf8ab20.avif?t=1755661994\" data-has-big width=1560 height=494 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are resources that you can collect to improve your gear and vehicles for your mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MYSTERY &amp; POWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/eaa4928a272da429e9f501641c41015f.avif?t=1755661994\" data-has-big width=1600 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cryptic messages guide you toward strange powers that could change the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781420?t=1755661994","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/store